# WHY: a signing key committed to a repository lets anyone who clones it publish an update
# to this app under the same signature, and the key cannot be rotated without breaking every
# existing install. The credentials belong in ~/.gradle/gradle.properties (user level, outside
# the repo) or in CI secrets - see the signing block at the top of app/build.gradle.kts.
*.jks
*.keystore
keystore.properties
signing.properties
